    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31036" root="عوف" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُمُّ عُوَيْفٍ</span></b>  <i>A small creeping thing</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُوَيَّبَةٌ</span>), <i>other
than the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرَادَة</span> [which is termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُمُّ عَوْفٍ</span>]. (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And, accord. to AHát, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبُو عَوْفٍ</span> <i>A species of
the</i> [<i>beetles called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِعْلَان</span> [pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُعَلٌ</span>]: it is <i>a
small creeping thing</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُوَيْبَّة</span>), <i>dust-coloured, that
excavates with its tail and with its two horns, and</i>
[<i>then</i>] <i>never appears.</i> (TA.)

